# B&B Sample Diet PDF (`b&bsamplediet.pdf`)

Formerly the 1982 “5-page” sample-female printout. **Separate from the 2026 program report** (`burn-and-build-diet-kristi-*.pdf`).

**Deliverable filename:** `docs/samples/b&bsamplediet.pdf` — stable name, overwritten each render. This is the PDF headed for customer delivery.

**Pages:** Welcome → Lean Body Analysis → Food Plan → Servings → Food List (protein/grains) → Food List (vegetables/fruit) — **6 pages**.

When the user asks for **sample diet**, **sample-female**, **b&samplediet**, or legacy **five-page** work, use this pipeline — not `render:program-report-preview`.

## Pipeline

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| Renderer | `server/pdf/renderFivePagePrintout.js` |
| Frame / header | `server/pdf/draw1982Frame.js` |
| Food list pages | `server/pdf/drawStaplesFoodListPages.js` |
| Payload | `js/fivePagePrintoutData.js` → `buildKristiFivePagePreviewPayload()` |
| Copy | `js/fivePagePrintoutCopyData.js` |
| Render script | `scripts/render-sample-diet-preview.mjs` |
| Deliverable | `docs/samples/b&bsamplediet.pdf` |

Run: `npm run render:sample-diet-preview` (alias: `render:five-page-preview`)

## Delivery order (critical — tell the user)

The download link is a **raw GitHub URL**. It serves whatever is **committed on `main`**.

**Required order every time:**

1. Edit renderer / payload / copy
2. `npm run render:sample-diet-preview`
3. **Commit** `docs/samples/b&bsamplediet.pdf` (and code changes)
4. **`git push origin main`**
5. **Only then** paste the download link

Say explicitly: *“Pushed to main — tap this link; it saves to Downloads as `b&bsamplediet.pdf`.”*

## Give the user (one link only)

```
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/koryedwards-del/landing-burn-and-build/main/docs/samples/b%26bsamplediet.pdf
```

(`&` is URL-encoded as `%26`.)

- **One** stable filename — do not send numbered `bb-five-page-sample-female-N.pdf` or program-report links.
- Do not link before push.

## Do not

| Wrong | Why |
|-------|-----|
| Link before push | GitHub still serves old bytes |
| `render:program-report-preview` for sample diet | Wrong product (12+ pages) |
| Cursor artifacts panel | Broken download UX on Cursor Web |
| `github.com/.../blob/...` | Opens browser; does not download |

## Sanity check after render

**6 pages**, ~70 KB, Times fonts, full header every page, food lists without tips. If ~50 KB / 4 pages, food lists missing. If ~180 KB / 13+ pages, wrong renderer.
